      This supplement replaces Section 3 on the previous version of Form I-9. Only
      use this page if your employee requires reverification, is rehired within three
      years of the date the original Form I-9 was completed, or provides proof of
      a legal name change. Enter the employee''s name in the fields above. Use a new
      section for each reverification or rehire. Review the Form I-9 instructions
      before completing this page. Keep this page as part of the employee''s Form
      I-9 record. Additional guidance can be found in the Handbood for Employers:
